=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# Configure DNS ################################################$
$
# DNS Configuration --------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Nameservers          192.0.2.54, 2001:db8::54$
   -  Search Domains       example.net$
   -  Proxmox VE's DNS settings rewrite /etc/resolv.conf$
$
   -  Set the nameservers$
      /etc/resolv.conf$
      @@ -1,2 +1,3 @@$
       search example.net$
      -nameserver 192.0.2.1$
      +nameserver 192.0.2.54$
      +nameserver 2001:db8::54$
$
  Configure DNS? [y/N, 0 or q]: y$

